# =============================================================================
# Build context = allowlist.
# Only what Dockerfile.trixie actually COPYs is sent to the Docker daemon.
# Anything new that must go into the image has to be added here explicitly.
# =============================================================================
*

!requirements.txt
!image/

# Never ship local junk even if it lands inside image/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
